        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BEDSTEAD</strong> used in Deuteronomy 3:11, but elsewhere rendered “couch,” “bed.” In 2 Kings 1:4; 16:2; Psalm 132:3; Amos 3:12, the divan is meant by this word.",
